{
  "bodyHash": "9a2b9d4081671185",
  "content": "<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/logo.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 此修改会逐渐增加游戏难度，灵感来源于类似<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.terraria.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terraria</a>的机制。同时，本修改也会随着<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fDifficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\">区域难度</a>的增长而增加难度，以维持Minecraft的风格。<br>关于本修改的详细信息请参阅：<a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsProgressiveDifficultyMod/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。<br><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">自版本0.4.0起，本修改需要<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majrusz-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Majrusz Library</a>才能正常运行！</span></strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/game_stages.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 游戏进度被分为若干阶段，每一阶段提供新的难度调整并改善之前的设定。目前共有三个阶段：<br><br>- <strong>普通模式</strong>，从游戏一开始即开始激活。<br>- <strong>专家模式</strong>，当第一位玩家进入下界（或其他模组添加的维度）时激活。<br>- <strong>大师模式</strong>，当你击败末影龙时激活。</span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/stuff.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>敌人群体</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">敌人以群体形式出现，包含一个首领和跟随者，他们会像首领一样攻击同一目标。<br>跟随者更有可能持有武器，而首领则更有可能穿戴盔甲。</span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/group.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>不死军团</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">不死军团是一种新出现的袭击活动，在击杀一定数量的不死生物后触发。最多有5波袭击，完成后可获得宝箱奖励，难度会随时间增长，同时参与的玩家越多，难度也越高！</span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/undead_army.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>宝藏袋</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">这些灵感来自Terraria的新袋子包含额外 loot，并且有几率出现唯一物品。每个玩家在协助击败袭击或BOSS时会获得自己的宝藏袋。目前可以通过以下方式获取：<strong>钓鱼</strong>、<strong>不死军团</strong>、<strong>袭击</strong>、<strong>远古守卫者</strong>、<strong>卫道士</strong>、<strong>凋零</strong>和<strong>末影龙</strong>。</span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/treasure_bags.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>出血</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">现在每个动物和人类都会流血，这是一种造成与中毒相似伤害的效果，可以用新物品<strong>绷带</strong>去除。此效果可由剑、蜘蛛甚至仙人掌等多种来源造成……但你的盔甲越多，流血的概率越低！请务必随身携带绷带，因为随着阶段增加，出血将变得越来越致命！</span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/bleeding.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>末金锭</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">尽管后期做了多项难度调整，但仍然可以找到一种名为<strong>末金</strong>的新矿石。<br>利用这种矿石可制作末金锭，用于升级黑曜石盔甲和工具！<strong>末金</strong>矿石出现在末地石中，也可在末地结构中找到。</span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/enderium_ingot.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以及更多内容！</span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/languages.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"185\"> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/thanks.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fmusiqeorn%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Julia</a>负责音效<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chechnyacool488\" rel=\"nofollow\">chechnyacool488</a>, reyzex#1973, LolsShow, Faster Than Light团队负责俄文翻译<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/muraokun/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">muraokun</a>负责部分贴图<br>- <a href=\"https://github.com/qsefthuopq\" rel=\"nofollow\">qsefthuopq</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/1mtwtfss1\" rel=\"nofollow\">1mtwtfss1</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/UDTakerBean\" rel=\"nofollow\">UDTakerBea</a>负责中文翻译<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kiryonn\" rel=\"nofollow\">kiryonn</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/maximemadani\" rel=\"nofollow\">maximemadani</a>负责法文翻译<br>- Wallaby#8683, <a href=\"https://github.com/luskaner\" rel=\"nofollow\">luskaner</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/spliitbtw\" rel=\"nofollow\">spliitbtw</a>负责西班牙文翻译<br>- <a href=\"https://github.com/baooduy\" rel=\"nofollow\">baooduy</a>负责越南文翻译<br>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252flcycrystal%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IcyCrystal</a>负责所有末金物品和方块的重绘<br>- <a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a>负责乌克兰文翻译<br>- <a href=\"https://github.com/florian-berger\" rel=\"nofollow\">florian-berger</a>负责德文翻译<br>- <a href=\"https://github.com/zacky0904\" rel=\"nofollow\">zacky0904</a>负责繁体中文翻译<br>- もふざとう (mohuzato) 负责日文翻译</span> <br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UF774WcuW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a> <br><a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsProgressiveDifficultyMod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/mod_wiki.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a></h6>",
